  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2022/12/IMG_3365.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p><p>(15 fotos) La florister&iacute;a El Jard&iacute;n de Elena, situada en el Pla de Onda, en el paseo peatonal que va hasta la calle San Miguel, tiene todo lo necesario para decorar la Navidad, incluso con una buena variedad de &aacute;rboles navide&ntilde;os.</p><p></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/eljardindeelenanadal/IMG_3337.JPG\" alt=\"IMG_3337\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/eljardindeelenanadal/IMG_3346.JPG\" alt=\"IMG_3346\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/eljardindeelenanadal/IMG_3357.JPG\" alt=\"IMG_3357\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/eljardindeelenanadal/IMG_3359.JPG\" alt=\"IMG_3359\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/eljardindeelenanadal/IMG_3364.JPG\" alt=\"IMG_3364\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/eljardindeelenanadal/IMG_3365.JPG\" alt=\"IMG_3365\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/eljardindeelenanadal/IMG_3368.JPG\" alt=\"IMG_3368\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/eljardindeelenanadal/IMG_3371.JPG\" alt=\"IMG_3371\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/eljardindeelenanadal/IMG_3372.JPG\" alt=\"IMG_3372\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/eljardindeelenanadal/IMG_3